WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.670
Your fingertip brushes a hot pan.

2
00:00:02.720 --> 00:00:06.150
Before you know it, your
hand is already in the air.

3
00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:08.570
Only then does the pain arrive.

4
00:00:08.620 --> 00:00:12.260
The movement comes first;
the feeling comes second.

5
00:00:12.310 --> 00:00:17.370
This is a reflex: a rapid,
automatic response to a stimulus.

6
00:00:17.420 --> 00:00:21.660
So why does your hand jerk away
before you have even felt the pain?

7
00:00:21.710 --> 00:00:25.340
In this mission, you'll follow a
signal from a receptor in the skin,

8
00:00:25.390 --> 00:00:28.630
through the nervous system,
to the muscle that moves.

9
00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:32.160
Then you'll build a reflex
arc, frame by frame:

10
00:00:32.210 --> 00:00:35.210
just three nerve cells and two synapses.

11
00:00:35.260 --> 00:00:39.890
Your mission: find out why your hand
jerks away before you have even felt the

12
00:00:39.940 --> 00:00:40.520
pain.
